    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-horrĕo</span></b> , ēre,
			v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to tremble</i> or <i>shudder
				exceedingly at</i> any thing, <i>to be terrified
				at</i>, <i>to dread</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aestus, Col. pöet. 10, 154: mortem sic
					quisquam exhorruit, ut, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					8, 196</span></i>
			.</div>
